      "question": "What kinds of behaviours of young children can make their parents feel proud?",
      "idea": "I would say the clearest sign is when children actively learn to put others first. While young kids naturally focus on their own games, stepping forward to help out their family allows them to demonstrate emotional maturity. Take my young nephew as an example: he patiently showed his grandparents how to use a smartphone without once losing his patience. Such selfless acts play a major role in shaping a child's character, which allows them to easily achieve success through strong social skills later in life.",
      "ideaFormatted": {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "label": "Direct Answer & Explanation",
            "text": "I would say the clearest sign is when children actively learn to put others first. While young kids naturally focus on their own games, stepping forward to help out their family allows them to demonstrate emotional maturity."
          },
          {
            "kind": "paragraph",
            "label": "Example",
            "text": "Take my young nephew as an example: he patiently showed his grandparents how to use a smartphone without once losing his patience."
          },
          {
