      "userEdited": "I think parents feel proud when their children show kindness and are willing to help others. Young children can be quite self-centred at times, so it's lovely to see them care about people around them. For example, my young nephew once patiently showed his grandparents how to use a smartphone without getting annoyed. I think these small acts of kindness help children develop a caring personality and build good relationships with others as they grow up."
